## File Structure

```
src/
├── contexts/
│   └── ImplicitContextStore.tsx    # Central context store
├── hooks/
│   ├── useRouteContext.ts          # Step 1
│   ├── useSelectionContext.ts      # Step 2
│   ├── useVisibleContext.ts        # Step 3
│   ├── useRecentActions.ts         # Step 4
│   ├── useFocusedContext.ts        # Step 5
│   └── useImplicitContextSender.ts # Step 7
└── services/
    └── ContextAggregator.ts        # Step 6
```

---

## Debounce & Throttling Rules

| Context Type | Debounce | Throttle |
|--------------|----------|----------|
| Route | - | - |
| Selections | 300ms | - |
| Visible | - | 500ms |
| Recent Actions | - | - |
| Focused | - | - |
| Final Send | - | 3s minimum between sends |

---

## Privacy Considerations

1. **User Consent**: Add toggle to enable/disable implicit context
2. **Data Retention**: Don't store context beyond session
3. **Opt-out**: Allow users to clear context manually
4. **Transparency**: Show what context was sent with each AI response
